  (#("program.) Because many Web programs did what scripting languages supported best, the Web elevated" 0 8 (pdf-text-emph italic)) 0.12095 0.90421 0.54327 0.55485 0.55485 0.01158 0.00673 0.2764 0.0735 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 13 "BNGUHG+NimbusRomNo9L-ReguItal" nil)
  ("these languages from hobbyist projects to entities enjoying widespread corporate support." 0.12095 0.77787 0.55936 0.57094 0.57094 0.01158 0.00458 0.2725 0.0377 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 10 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
  ("The teaching of programming languages (PL) has not kept pace with these developments. Many books" 0.14104 0.90421 0.57545 0.58704 0.58648 0.01158 0.00559 0.2813 0.0285 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 14 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
