  ("rigorously adhere to the sacred division of languages into “functional”, “imperative”, “object-oriented”," 0.12095 0.90421 0.65592 0.66751 0.66751 0.01158 0.00676 0.2287 0.0753 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 11 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
