  (#("early days of our discipline: a misguided attempt to follow the practice of science rather than its spirit." 64 73 (pdf-text-emph italic) 100 106 (pdf-text-emph italic)) 0.12095 0.87251 0.68811 0.69969 0.69969 0.01158 0.00458 0.3038 0.0366 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 17 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
