  ("If languages are not defined by taxonomies, how are they constructed? They are aggregations of features." 0.12095 0.90421 0.53219 0.54378 0.54378 0.01158 0.0055 0.2395 0.0122 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 15 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
  ("Rather than study extant languages as a whole, which conflates the essential with the accidental, it is more" 0.12095 0.90421 0.54829 0.55987 0.55987 0.01158 0.00489 0.3011 0.0489 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 17 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
  ("instructive to decompose them into constituent features, which in turn can be studied individually. The" 0.12095 0.90421 0.56438 0.57597 0.57597 0.01158 0.00696 0.2603 0.0766 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 14 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
