  ("This vision of systems as compositions of features is widespread in software engineering, especially in" 0.14104 0.90421 0.59657 0.60815 0.60815 0.01158 0.00533 0.2808 0.0326 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 14 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
