  ("I like to think, they have a much better sense of the mistakes common scripting languages have made, and" 0.12095 0.90421 0.69313 0.70472 0.70472 0.01158 0.005 0.3053 0.0061 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 18 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
