  ("Of course, combining features demands also reasoning about their interactions. PLAI has some exercises" 0.14104 0.9042 0.72532 0.7369 0.73634 0.01158 0.00453 0.2972 0.0193 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 13 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
