  ("These trade-offs are unsurprising: they are simply special cases of, respectively, inductive and deductive" 0.14104 0.90421 0.26324 0.27482 0.27482 0.01158 0.00469 0.2642 0.0438 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" 0.0130 nil nil 13 "WSWLVM+NimbusRomNo9L-Regu" nil)
